# CV Builder template files are Go html/template source (their own
# {{...}} action syntax, and a literal <!--STYLE--> marker
# registry.go's own Render function replaces verbatim) — Prettier's
# HTML/CSS parsers don't understand that syntax and will reformat
# around it unpredictably (confirmed live: it inserted line breaks
# splitting adjacent {{end}}/{{if}} actions). Functionally harmless
# today, but defeats the whole point of this folder ("easy to modify")
# if every `prettier --write` run keeps reshuffling hand-tuned
# whitespace inside them. See
# tools/career/backend/cvbuilder/templates/sync-from-frontend.sh's own
# doc comment.
